ok - an edit updates the same item, re-notifies once, and is reported as a correction
ok - a captain response clears the item with its evidence preserved, and no re-read reopens it
ok - an interrupted read retries from its own checkpoint, and an unavailable source stays unknown
ok - a gap while the laptop slept is caught up from each checkpoint, and freshness is exposed
