ok - a cross-source duplicate retains every provenance and stays one item
ok - notifications are refused until the recipient is verified, then grouped, rate-limited and severity-scoped
ok - quiet hours defer ordinary alerts without dropping them, and a service outage still gets through
ok - an automation candidate is a proposal only: nothing reaches the Action Deck and nothing becomes executable
